          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "models/gemini-2.5-flash"
        },
        "text": "=Analyze this image for SEO and User Experience.\n\n**Context:**\n- Post Title: \"{{ $('get earliest unpublished post').item.json.blog_posts[0].title }}\"\n- Current Alt/Placeholder: \"{{ $('loop over images').item.json.alt_text }}\"\n- Original Filename: \"{{ $json.filename }}\"\n\n**Your Task:**\n1. **Filename:** Rename the file to be SEO-friendly (lowercase, kebab-case) using keywords relevant to the visual content and the post title.\n2. **Alt Text:** Write a strictly descriptive text for accessibility/SEO (describe what is physically in the image for someone who cannot see it).\n3. **Caption:** Write an engaging caption for the human reader. This should provide context, relate the image to the Post Title, or add a short interesting fact. Do NOT just describe the image again.\n\n**OUTPUT JSON ONLY:**\n{\n  \"new_filename\": \"keyword-rich-description-of-image.jpg\",\n  \"seo_alt_text\": \"A literal description of the visual elements (e.g. 'A plate of spicy mapo tofu with red chili oil').\",\n  \"image_caption\": \"Mapo Tofu is a staple of Sichuan cuisine, known for its numbing peppercorn heat.\"\n}",
        "inputType": "binary",
        "options": {}
